1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:10,700
Meskerem 2012. At midday I left Ankober.
Just one backpack. A friend saw me off.

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:17,533
A gravel road as far as Debre Birhan.
After that, asphalt.

3
00:00:18,233 --> 00:00:22,823
I sat by the window. Outside, only
forest and mountains.

4
00:00:22,823 --> 00:00:24,533
The view amazed me.

5
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:31,353
I reached Lamberet after dark. My friend
was there, waiting for me.

6
00:00:31,353 --> 00:00:35,408
People, lights, cars, everything at
once.

7
00:00:40,108 --> 00:00:43,108
At Autobus Tera the brokers closed in on
us.

8
00:00:43,108 --> 00:00:47,748
"Do you want a bed?" "A bed?" From every
side. We were lost.

9
00:00:47,748 --> 00:00:50,158
In the end we picked one.

10
00:00:50,858 --> 00:00:58,158
One bed in the room. Not very good, not
bad. But clean.

11
00:00:58,858 --> 00:01:03,658
In the morning we stood in a long queue
and got the ticket.

12
00:01:04,358 --> 00:01:10,188
Today, remembering that first night, I
tell all who leave home one thing:

13
00:01:10,188 --> 00:01:15,408
the first night is always confusing. Do
not run from it. Savour it.

